## Provenance and integration boundary

- Worktree: `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/curator/.temp/TASK-260720-3pwg2w/worktree`
- Exact base: `origin/main` at `17804ceae42d3bb62abf6e8a9d9cbef6dd5370b8`
